Description: Drop the legacy be/ include prefix
 The packaged headers live under the system include root without a be/
 level (<app/Application.h> and friends), so the be/ prefixed form
 never resolves. Mechanical rewrite of the include directives only; no
 other source line changes.
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <packages@vitruvianos.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: upstream
